  "step_2": "The decision reason prefers the lottery that is more left-skewed. Since the favorable outcome (non-zero) has a higher probability (34% vs. 33%) in Lottery B, it is more left-skewed than Lottery A. Therefore, the decision reason prefers Lottery B.",
  "final_answer": "B"
}

